# Generated data. api/ is NOT committed (untracked 2026-07-19): Pages
# deploys it as a build artifact, and versioning ~75 MB of 4x-daily churn
# would balloon the git history. Pushes deploy the last scheduled build's
# cached api/ (see build-deploy.yml). The store dump and caches stay local.
api/
data/*
!data/locations.csv
!data/buoys.csv
!data/mop_transects.csv
# Generated locally by backend/build_spot_orientation.py (needs the Salix
# grids, which CI does not have), so it is committed like a vendored table.
!data/spot_orientation.csv
_site/

